       },
       "reviewBody": "This was so good! Super easy and enjoyable. Hubby loved it, the kids left no scraps and the work team enjoyed the leftovers. A few things to add that I did differently (totally delicious without the additional changes, but this is what worked best for us) Add some minced garlic on top of the fresh garlic (trust me, you’ll thank me later) Once cooked, transfer to an oven baking dish. Sprinkle with some paprika and then bake for a little while longer, uncovered (15min) Mmm voila!",
